        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Concepts: Island gigantism, island rule\n- Animals: Key deer\n- Places: North America\n- Time: 1965\n\nFacts:\n- Island gigantism is a specific aspect of the island rule, a theory about how animals evolve larger bodies on islands.\n- The Key deer is the smallest North American deer described as subject to the island rule.\n- The statement associates the Key deer with a publication in 1965.",
